  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 31116484608
    m_Localized: What did you tell him excactly after arriving in the apartment?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124873216
    m_Localized: Well i didnt exactly speak, i screamed " YOU STRANGLED HER YOU FUCKING
      PSYCHO"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124873217
    m_Localized: I was afraid I wanted someone to hear. Construction work were going
      at this hour so i thought people might not hear me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124873218
    m_Localized: Cassidy felt something is strange somehow. I dont know how.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124873219
    m_Localized: It was too late for Sophie though. What will life be from now huh?
      Without her?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 31124873220
    m_Localized: Hm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
